   "sanctioned_words_after": 0,
   "sanctioned_words_during": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "sec3-3",
   "section": "Activism",
   "text": "She has since been part of other activism projects such as writing an open letter to the BBC that was signed by over 20,000 people, calling for them to be held accountable for publishing the article originally titled \"We're being pressured into sex by some trans women\", which the letter greatly criticized for, among other things, publishing the results of a study that the letter labelled as \"deeply flawed\".",
   "words": 71,
